# Example environment for ProCoderJii Notes. Copy to .env.local for local development.
# Active example values are public. Never put passwords or private keys in this file.
# For production, set these in your hosting provider's environment settings (see docs/deployment.md).

# Public id of the @Pro_coder_ji YouTube channel. Enables the "Latest videos" section on the
# home page (read from the channel's public feed; no API key). Leave unset to hide the section.
YOUTUBE_CHANNEL_ID=UC74q2pzSGuoaikYwnavcGMg

# Canonical site origin. Optional: it defaults to https://procoderji.com, so only set it to override
# (for example on a staging build). It is compiled in at build time.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://procoderji.com

# Optional ASP.NET Core backend. This URL is server-only; it is never sent to the browser.
# Leave unset for free guest practice with browser-local progress.
# Google client secrets belong in .NET user-secrets or the backend host's secret configuration.
# See backend/README.md for Google OAuth, database setup, and deployment.
# DOTNET_API_URL=http://localhost:5100
